{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:53:15+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:53:15+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Holcim AG","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"Switzerland","city":"Zug","website":"https://www.holcim.com","employees":50000,"summary":"Holcim AG, together with its subsidiaries, provides building materials and solutions in Europe, Latin America, and Asia, Middle East, and Africa. It provides foundation, flooring, walling and roofing products, including cement, clinker, and other cementitious materials; ready-mix concrete; aggregates, such as crushed stone, gravel, and sand; and precast, concrete products, asphalts, mortars, roofing systems, insulation systems, tile adhesives, facade solutions, and contracting and services. The company also provides digital services through HOLCIM+ platform and digital concrete services. Its products are used in infrastructure projects, such as tunnels, railways and train stations, airports and ports, and bridges; housing projects, including individual and collective housing; commercial projects comprising offices, retail, and public buildings; and industrial projects consisting of renewable energy, oil and gas, and mining. The company sells its products under the ECOPact, ECOPlanet, ECOCycle, Ytong, Aggneo, Hydromedia, ZinCo Holcim, Elevate, Airium, PRB Group, Cantillana, Flachdach Technologie, Izolbet, Disensa, Tector, DYNAMax, Agilia, Ductal, Artevia, Humes, Tensolite, Compaktuna, and other service brands. The company was formerly known as LafargeHolcim Ltd and changed its name to Holcim AG in May 2021. Holcim AG was founded in 1833 and is headquartered in Zug, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Holcim AG, avec ses filiales, fournit des matériaux et des solutions de construction en Europe, en Amérique latine, en Asie, au Moyen-Orient et en Afrique. Elle fournit des produits de fondation, des revêtements de sol, des murs et des toitures, y compris du ciment, du clinker et d'autres matériaux cimentaires; du béton prêt à l'emploi; des agrégats, tels que la pierre concassée, le gravier et le sable; et des produits préfabriqués, du béton, des asphaltes, des mortiers, des systèmes de toiture, des systèmes d'isolation, des adhésifs de tuiles, des solutions de façade et des services. La société fournit également des services numériques via la plate-forme HOLCIM + et des services de béton numérique."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":35178758144,"shares_outstanding":553125111,"trailing_pe":90.85714,"forward_pe":14.835273,"price_to_book":2.2292323,"ev_to_ebitda":14.804,"ev_to_revenue":2.804,"dividend_yield":0.026199998,"payout_ratio":2.4286,"beta_yahoo":0.716},"targets":{"current_price":63.6,"mean":80.60526,"median":82.5,"high":93.0,"low":63.0,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":2.15789,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-31"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":4574400000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":"2025-05-22"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.08778,"institutions_pct":0.46765998,"institutions_float_pct":0.51265997,"institutions_n":558,"institutions":[],"funds":[],"insider_trades":[]},"estimates":[{"period":"0q","end_date":"2026-09-30","eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"eps_year_ago":null,"eps_n":null,"eps_growth":null,"rev_avg":4574400000,"rev_low":4548000000,"rev_high":4591000000,"rev_year_ago":4036000000,"rev_n":5,"rev_growth":0.13340001,"eps_trend_now":null,"eps_trend_30d":null,"eps_trend_90d":null},{"period":"+1q","end_date":"2026-12-31","eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"eps_year_ago":null,"eps_n":null,"eps_growth":null,"rev_avg":4444500000,"rev_low":4432000000,"rev_high":4457000000,"rev_year_ago":3818000000,"rev_n":2,"rev_growth":0.16409999,"eps_trend_now":null,"eps_trend_30d":null,"eps_trend_90d":null},{"peri